analyze_re.HERE point at the scratch folder (so analyze_re.configs_meta, survey_scores, null_scores, load_swap and
step_primary see only synthetic files written here), and every data path of the script is pointed there. The stored
files the gates compare against are built independently: the two primary files with analyze_re.step_primary (as the
