Writes only its output file (--out) and synthetic files in a new scratch folder
neuro/_trash/test_report_continuity_scratch_<UTC time>/ (inside neuro/, never deleted by the test).
Usage: OMP_NUM_THREADS=2 $PY -B -I explore/test_report_continuity.py --out explore/tests_report_continuity_output.txt
Written 20 November 2026.
